msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Pinagmulan {#background}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates how to build a `Qiskit pattern` for cutting gates"
" in a quantum circuit to reduce circuit depth. For more in-depth discussion "
"on circuit cutting, visit the [circuit cutting Qiskit addon "
"docs](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-cutting/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinakikita ng tutorial na ito kung paano bumuo ng `Qiskit pattern` para sa "
"pagputol ng mga gate sa quantum circuit upang bawasan ang lalim ng circuit. "
"Para sa mas malalim na talakayan tungkol sa pagputol ng circuit, bisitahin "
"ang [circuit cutting Qiskit addon docs](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-"
"addon-cutting/).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements}"
msgstr "Mga Kinakailangan {#requirements}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before starting this tutorial, be sure you have the following installed:\n"
"- Qiskit SDK v2.0 or later, with [visualization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization) support\n"
"- Qiskit Runtime v0.22 or later (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`)\n"
"- Circuit cutting Qiskit addon v0.9.0 or later (`pip install qiskit-addon-cutting`)\n"
msgstr ""
"Bago magsimula sa tutorial na ito, siguraduhing mayroon kayong naka-install na sumusunod:\n"
"- Qiskit SDK v2.0 o mas bago, na may suportang [visualization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization)\n"
"- Qiskit Runtime v0.22 o mas bago (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`)\n"
"- Circuit cutting Qiskit addon v0.9.0 o mas bago (`pip install qiskit-addon-cutting`)\n"

